OL,3,GNEWSAJudge extends order barring
OL,4,A'Travellers' from field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is waiting to see whether
OL,7,Fmembers of the "Gypsy-Traveller
OL,8,Fcommunity" will challenge a High Court
OL,9,Forder barring unauthorised development
OL,10,Fin a field.
OL,12,FA High Court judge has extended an
OL,13,Finjunction, made in August after
OL,14,Fdiggers were driven on to the field in
OL,15,FSawbridgeworth, Hertfordshire.
OL,17,FMr Justice Lavender said the injunction
OL,18,Fwould apply until a full trial of the
OL,19,Fcouncil's legal claim went to court,
OL,20,Fbut he said his latest order could be
OL,21,Fchallenged by the defendants.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
