OL,3,GNEWSAJudge extends order barring
OL,4,A'Travellers' from field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barrister representing East
OL,7,FHertfordshire District Council, which
OL,8,Fhad applied for the injunction, said it
OL,9,Fwas thought those behind the
OL,10,Fdevelopment wanted to create a
OL,11,FTravellers' site at the field, off
OL,12,FSheering Mill Lane.
